{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Mass.BindingHyperbolicRecurrence","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Mass.BindingHyperbolicRecurrence","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.QBeta.ReebTowerJacobiAnger"],"declarations":4,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.BindingHyperbolicRecurrence.binding_trace_two_cosh","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.BindingHyperbolicRecurrence.binding_trace_two_cosh","kind":"theorem","line":77,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/BindingHyperbolicRecurrence.lean#L77-L83","doc":"**The binding trace is `2 cosh θ` when the eigenvalue is `e^θ`.** `e^θ + (e^θ)⁻¹ = 2 cosh θ`,\nso the `det = +1` pair `λ = e^θ`, `λ⁻¹ = e^{−θ}` has trace `τ = 2 cosh θ` — the hyperbolic-angle\nform of the depth-2 binding trace `τ = 2 cosh θ_binding ≈ 2.6424` (`θ_binding ≈ 0.78145`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.BindingHyperbolicRecurrence.sinh_satisfies_binding_recurrence","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.BindingHyperbolicRecurrence.sinh_satisfies_binding_recurrence","kind":"theorem","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/BindingHyperbolicRecurrence.lean#L65-L75","doc":"**`sinh(nθ)` is the ODD solution of the depth-2 binding recurrence** with `τ = 2 cosh θ`:\n`sinh((n+2)θ) = 2 cosh θ · sinh((n+1)θ) − sinh(nθ)`. The binding-index specialisation of the\nbar-odd Reeb tower `reeb_tower_sinh_step`. Same recurrence as `cosh` — the recurrence is blind to\nthe even/odd boundary data; that is exactly the cosh/sinh degeneracy of a `det = +1` hyperbolic\ntransfer. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.BindingHyperbolicRecurrence.cosh_satisfies_binding_recurrence","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.BindingHyperbolicRecurrence.cosh_satisfies_binding_recurrence","kind":"theorem","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/BindingHyperbolicRecurrence.lean#L55-L63","doc":"**`cosh(nθ)` is the EVEN solution of the depth-2 binding recurrence** with `τ = 2 cosh θ`:\n`cosh((n+2)θ) = 2 cosh θ · cosh((n+1)θ) − cosh(nθ)`. The binding-index specialisation of the\nbar-even Reeb tower `reeb_tower_cosh_step` (at `a = (n+1)θ`, `η = θ`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.BindingHyperbolicRecurrence.binding_kernel_factors","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.BindingHyperbolicRecurrence.binding_kernel_factors","kind":"theorem","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/BindingHyperbolicRecurrence.lean#L44-L53","doc":"**The binding transfer kernel factors into a `det = +1` hyperbolic eigenvalue pair.**\n`R(q,x) = x² − (λ + λ⁻¹)x + 1 = (x − λ)(x − λ⁻¹)` for `λ ≠ 0`. The two roots `λ, λ⁻¹` multiply\nto `+1` — the SL₂(ℝ) hyperbolic pair `e^{±θ}` of the depth-2 binding recurrence. This is the\n`det = +1` companion of the Hecke curvature kernel `x²−(q−q⁻¹)x−1 = (x−q)(x+q⁻¹)` (`det = −1`,\n`QOU.Mass.HeckeStokes.stokes_curvature_factors`): binding is the *symmetric* hyperbolic face.\n(Not in the Reeb file — the binding-transfer determinant is the genuinely new datum here.) ","signatureChunk":0}]}